        "comment": "Forecast Snow Stability: Fresh deposits of unstable windslab will develop overnight and through the day, primarily on North-West to North aspects above 1000 metres. West and North- East aspects will also be affected due to cross loading. The greatest instability will be in steep locations such as gullies, gully tops, coire rims and convexities. On these aspects, fragile cornices will develop. The avalanche hazard will be Considerable.",
